OL,3,GNEWSASpinal surgery delay for teen with
OL,4,A'stabbing pain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has spoken of her distress at
OL,7,Fseeing her 14-year-old daughter suffer
OL,8,Fin pain after waiting more than a year
OL,9,Ffor spinal surgery.
OL,11,FJessica, from Hackness, near
OL,12,FScarborough, had been scheduled for an
OL,13,Foperation to treat her scoliosis in
OL,14,FSeptember, but it was cancelled with
OL,15,Fless than 24 hours' notice.
OL,17,FHer mother spoke out as figures show
OL,18,Fthe total number of cases awaiting
OL,19,Fadmission for surgery or procedures
OL,20,Facross hospitals in North, South and
OL,21,FWest Yorkshire has increased by a third
OL,22,Fsince 2021.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
