OL,3,GNEWSASpinal surgery delay for teen with
OL,4,A'stabbing pain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds Teaching Hospitals NHS Trust
OL,7,F(LTHT) has apologised to Jessica and
OL,8,Fsaid it was "working urgently" to
OL,9,Fensure her surgery takes place as soon
OL,10,Fas possible.
